        "@value": "Golden Grooves & Seasonal Tunes | Music4Life Ensemble"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Join Music4life Ensemble Sunday Dec 8th 2024 for a FREE, seniors-centric, musical event at St. Francis Centre Ajax!  Enjoy an afternoon of Golden Grooves & Seasonal Tunes...live music to keep our community happy, healthy and musically engaged. \nAn event proudly sponsored by\nAjax Partnership Fund."
      }
